#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:1
#: d52e5c436ed54886be18897fdce317e0
msgid "Sweeps, books and long runs"
msgstr "掃描、交易簿與長時間計算"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:3
#: 3e802bd8cc58402e82bf509c8c8170f9
msgid ""
"Everything on the bottom strip asks the *same* live graph a bigger "
"question. None of it rebuilds anything, and all of it can be called off."
msgstr "底部面板上的一切，都是對*同一份*即時物件圖提出更大的問題。它們都不重建任何東西，而且都可以中途叫停。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:6
#: 34147524a230454e84796a84aa2f9ae2
msgid "Sweeps"
msgstr "掃描"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:8
#: 3ef17d4936194a49bfc23b1a9075cb24
msgid ""
"Right-click a quote — or open the sweep panel — and N prices come back "
"off one graph in one frame, drawn as a ladder with the quote's live value"
" marked. Points come three ways, exactly one of:"
msgstr "在報價上按右鍵——或打開掃描面板——就會在一個訊框裡，從同一份物件圖上得到 N 個價格，畫成一張標出該報價當前值的階梯圖。取點有三種方式，恰好擇一："

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: f8558f575325482d99bec6e98bc02657
msgid "Form"
msgstr "形式"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: a12a7cf3d19d407496536853604fdff6
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "意義"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: bafb0d581abb4770987fdd98e51cd954
msgid "explicit"
msgstr "明列（explicit）"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: 700ada73ec0645e2af80e4d336da25b7
msgid "the values themselves"
msgstr "直接給值"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: 53c2fc672d8d4842b41441bb2f13f123
msgid "linear"
msgstr "線性（linear）"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: 3acdfc9df16f4320b8f98a85ff9f5de8
msgid "begin, end and a step count"
msgstr "起點、終點與步數"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: 468dac83039c457b8258cea3f1437b7d
msgid "relative"
msgstr "相對（relative）"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md
#: 94e77dbeecb14c1e9f2151539d73de31
msgid "multipliers of the quote's current value"
msgstr "對該報價目前值的倍數"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:18
#: 872d90d13725489c9410a1d2e240ec1c
msgid ""
"**A sweep is a question, not an edit.** Every swept quote is put back "
"afterwards, on the way out of a failure as well as a success. Clicking a "
"point on the ladder is the deliberate act that writes it: that sends a "
"real market write, with the value that was actually priced rather than an"
" interpolation off the chart."
msgstr "**掃描是一個問題，不是一次編輯。**每個被掃描的報價事後都會放回去，失敗時同樣會放回去。點擊階梯圖上的一點，才是把它寫下去的刻意動作：那會送出一次真正的市場寫入，用的是實際計過價的那個值，而不是從圖上內插出來的值。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:24
#: 95b216795f6149a68bb799e5b1073703
msgid ""
"The sweep panel: an axis card naming the quote S — Spot with its points "
"form set to linear, and a ladder of twenty-one prices, npv against S from"
" 80 to 120, with a dashed vertical line at the live value of 100. Above "
"the chart, a badge reading 21 points and the note \"isLive: 100.00 · "
"click a point to write it to the market\"."
msgstr ""
"掃描面板：一張軸卡片指名報價 S — Spot，points 形式設為 linear；右邊是一條由二十一個價格構成的階梯圖，npv 對 S 從 "
"80 到 120，並在活值 100 的位置畫了一條虛線。圖上方是一個寫著 21 points 的標籤，以及「isLive: 100.00 · "
"click a point to write it to the market」這句提示。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:28
#: 4740642f1c2e4d029368125f4b7b52a8
msgid ""
"Twenty-one prices off one graph in one request. The dashed line is where "
"the quote actually is, and the note beside it is exactly the distinction "
"above: the ladder is a question until you click a point, which is the act"
" that turns one of them into a write."
msgstr "同一份物件圖、同一個請求，二十一個價格。那條虛線就是這個報價現在真正的位置，而旁邊那句提示正是上面說的那個區別：階梯圖在你點下某一個點之前都只是一個問題，而點下去就是把其中一個變成寫入的那個動作。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:34
#: bee8232f49cf4b48aa56ebcfab5ed9c1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Anything that is a quote can be swept**, which now includes a "
"**correlation**. An off-diagonal of a correlation matrix can be a quote "
"id rather than a literal, and the sweep machinery does not know or care "
"what the number means. Sweeping the correlation of a two-asset minimum "
"basket from 0.1 to 0.9 in five steps gives 4.4125, 5.5304, 6.8433, 8.4825"
" and 10.8974 — which are five consecutive rows of the reference table "
"this build is checked against, produced in one request. That works only "
"because the service rereads the matrix on every request rather than "
"holding the factorised copy ({doc}`market`)."
msgstr ""
"**只要是報價就掃描得了**，而現在這包含了**相關係數**。相關係數矩陣的非對角線元素可以是一個報價 id "
"而不是字面數字，而掃描機制根本不知道、也不在乎那個數字代表什麼。把一個兩標的最小值一籃子的相關係數從 0.1 掃到 0.9、取五個點，得到 "
"4.4125、5.5304、6.8433、8.4825 與 "
"10.8974——那正是這個版本用來對照的參考表上連續五列的值，而且是在一次請求裡算出來的。這之所以行得通，只因為服務在每一次請求時都重新讀一次矩陣，而不是抱著那份已經分解好的副本（{doc}`market`）。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:43
#: 2bd74da3f83643d9948a4393ec3685a9
msgid "Grids"
msgstr "網格"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:45
#: 89ed67cd07cc40f485b1400131ed9394
msgid ""
"Press **add axis** and the sweep prices the *product* — spot at 21 points"
" against volatility at 5 is 105 prices, one request, one progress bar, "
"one cancel. The panel says so as you build it: `S × V = 27 prices, one "
"request`."
msgstr ""
"按下 **add axis**，掃描就會為*乘積*計價——現貨 21 點對波動率 5 點就是 105 "
"個價格，一個請求、一條進度條、一個取消鈕。你在編寫時面板會直說：`S × V = 27 prices, one request`。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:49
#: 9b567ff39472427c809ca87da1fa4c83
msgid ""
"Three rules the second axis adds, each of which the interface enforces "
"before the round trip:"
msgstr "第二軸帶來三條規則，介面在往返之前就一一把關："

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:52
#: eb556bbd1caf412787a56657ffdaed3f
msgid ""
"**A quote may appear on one axis only.** The later write would win at "
"every point, and the earlier axis would move nothing — which reads as a "
"flat dimension rather than as a mistake."
msgstr "**一個報價只能出現在一個軸上。**否則後寫入的那個會在每一點勝出，先前那一軸將什麼也推不動——讀起來像是一個平掉的維度，而不是一個錯誤。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:55
#: a128f98d49a44a6996ecff4d73297014
msgid ""
"**The product must fit the service's ceiling.** A grid multiplies, so a "
"step count one digit too long is a session-length request rather than a "
"slow one. The ceiling is advertised in the capabilities handshake, so the"
" app can refuse it locally."
msgstr "**乘積必須容得下服務的上限。**網格是相乘的，因此步數多寫一位數就不是慢一點的請求，而是一個工作階段長度的請求。上限在能力交握中公布，因此應用程式能在本地就拒絕它。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:59
#: a7526631e22445d2b45f78f98ae160a9
msgid "**Two axes at most.** A third would price perfectly well and draw nothing."
msgstr "**最多兩軸。**第三軸完全算得出來，卻畫不出東西。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:61
#: 232d30584d8e4ad489c621f945c0af15
msgid ""
"A grid draws as a line per value of the second axis rather than as a heat"
" map, because a price read off a colour is a guess."
msgstr "網格畫成第二軸每個值一條線，而不是熱區圖，因為從顏色讀出來的價格是用猜的。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:64
#: c9caad87a0494c6b8eda2428bff130a5
msgid ""
"The sweep panel with two axis cards side by side — axis 1, drawn along x,"
" 21 points, quote S — Spot, linear; axis 2, one line per value, 5 points,"
" quote V — Volatility, relative. The chart reads NPV against S and V with"
" a badge of 105 points, and draws five coloured lines with a legend "
"naming V 0.16 through V 0.24."
msgstr ""
"掃描面板上並排的兩張軸卡片——軸 1：沿著 x 畫、21 個點、報價 S — Spot、linear；軸 2：每個值一條線、5 個點、報價 V —"
" Volatility、relative。圖表標題是 NPV against S and V，標籤寫著 105 "
"points，畫出五條彩色的線，圖例分別是 V 0.16 到 V 0.24。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:68
#: 421a717cbcd041768dfad9fd8d346bd0
msgid ""
"Twenty-one spots against five volatilities: 105 prices, one request, one "
"warm graph. Each card says what its axis does — the first is drawn along "
"x, the second is one line per value — and the legend names the five "
"volatilities, which is what a colour scale could not have done."
msgstr ""
"二十一個現貨對五個波動率：105 個價格、一個請求、一份熱著的物件圖。每張卡片都說明自己那個軸在做什麼——第一個沿著 x "
"畫，第二個是每個值一條線——而圖例直接寫出那五個波動率，這是色階做不到的事。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:74
#: 754cf6d8c4f442ca9df41534ce107ed2
msgid "Monte Carlo progress"
msgstr "蒙地卡羅進度"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:76
#: 9300d8ec230f43cd850107dbbca96b6f
msgid ""
"Set a progress interval and a long run reports as it goes: a progress "
"bar, a convergence trace, and a cancel that stops work *between batches*."
" Measured on the reference trade, ten progress frames for a 200,000-path "
"run settling at $9.307731 \\pm 0.031144$ against an analytic $9.297476$."
msgstr ""
"設定進度間隔，長時間計算就會邊跑邊回報：一條進度條、一段收斂軌跡，以及一個在*批次之間*停下工作的取消鈕。在基準交易上實測，20 "
"萬條路徑的計算送出十個進度訊框，收斂在 $9.307731 \\pm 0.031144$，而解析解為 $9.297476$。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:81
#: bf05c83259aa4582bc513564fed9d1d8
msgid ""
"The Monte Carlo panel mid-run: an in-flight badge beside a cancel button,"
" a progress bar about a sixth of the way across, the counter 32,000,000 "
"of 200,000,000 paths, a running NPV of 9.300318, and a convergence trace "
"of running NPV against paths settling towards 9.30."
msgstr ""
"跑到一半的蒙地卡羅面板：in-flight 標籤旁邊是一個 cancel 按鈕，進度條大約走了六分之一，計數寫著 32,000,000 of "
"200,000,000 paths，running NPV 是 9.300318，右邊是一條 running NPV 對 paths "
"的收斂軌跡，正朝著 9.30 收斂。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:85
#: 84c0f7c787c249a5a654d1d6124d0679
msgid ""
"A run in flight. The bar and the counter come from the progress frames; "
"the trace is drawn from the running NPV each frame carries, which is what"
" shows whether the number has settled or is still wandering."
msgstr ""
"一次正在飛的計算。進度條與計數來自進度訊框；那條軌跡則是用每個訊框帶著的 running NPV "
"畫出來的，而這正是能看出這個數字究竟已經穩下來、還是還在游移的東西。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:90
#: d314ecb6f15d472fa6cc45e4465a989c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Remember that batching changes the estimate ({doc}`engines`), and that "
"the error estimate is the standard error of the mean, not a bound "
"({doc}`maths/numerics`)."
msgstr "別忘了分批會改變估計值（{doc}`engines`），而誤差估計是平均數的標準誤，不是一個界限（{doc}`maths/numerics`）。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:94
#: 4497069b46b147e28d019f132fb8247a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A long run also survives a dropped connection now. The service holds the "
"session and keeps the calculation going for its grace window, so a "
"network blink costs you the progress frames from that period and not the "
"run: the result is delivered when the app takes the session back "
"({doc}`interface`)."
msgstr "長時間計算現在也能撐過斷線。服務會保留工作階段，並在寬限期內讓計算繼續跑，因此網路閃斷讓你損失的是那段期間的進度訊框，而不是整段計算：當應用程式把工作階段接回來時，結果就會送達（{doc}`interface`）。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:99
#: d8ec7d0550a441d58dbfc31742bac075
msgid "The book"
msgstr "交易簿"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:101
#: b36b872da05245628068604a0009497f
msgid ""
"Press **add to book** and the trade is set aside beside the live one; "
"press **price the book** and all of them price against one graph in a "
"single request. They share this workbook's market by construction, which "
"is what makes the total a total rather than a coincidence."
msgstr ""
"按下 **add to book**，該筆交易就被擱在現行交易旁邊；按下 **price the "
"book**，它們全部在一個請求中對同一份物件圖計價。它們依建構方式共用這個工作簿的市場，這才使總和成為總和，而不是巧合。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:106
#: f5aa6e0d6b4c40c790bc636b1ec09874
msgid ""
"**One bad trade costs one row.** A trade that cannot price shows the "
"rejection it would have been sent on its own, on its own row, with the "
"rest keeping their numbers. Rows are named from the trades themselves — "
"nobody is asked to name forty of them."
msgstr "**一筆壞交易只賠掉一列。**無法計價的交易會在它自己那一列顯示——如果單獨送出時會收到的那個拒絕訊息，其餘各列保住自己的數字。列名取自交易本身，沒有人被要求替四十筆交易命名。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:111
#: 87e4d40cedec462788bc538dd81cfebc
msgid ""
"**A book has a ceiling, like a sweep.** Every row runs to completion on "
"the seat the request started on, so one frame can commit a great deal of "
"work, and the service says how many rows it will take in the same "
"handshake that carries the sweep ceiling. Past it the button closes and "
"says the number rather than letting the request go and come back refused."
msgstr "**一本部位也有上限，就像掃描一樣。** 每一列都會在這個請求起始的座位上跑到完，所以單一個訊框就能承諾非常大量的工作；服務會在帶著掃描上限的同一次握手裡，說出它最多收多少列。超過之後按鈕會關閉並把那個數字說出來，而不是讓請求送出去、再帶著拒絕回來。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:117
#: bce5f7c4a0cc4a669ba2cb97eef0ab15
msgid ""
"The book panel: three trades, one request, total 28.137020. Row one, a "
"call at 100 on the analytic engine, prices to 9.297476; row two, a put at"
" 120, to 18.839544; row three, the same put on an American exercise, "
"carries a red rejection naming "
"instrument.option.exercise.payoff_at_expiry where its price would be."
msgstr ""
"部位面板：三筆交易、一個請求、合計 28.137020。第一列是履約價 100 的買權、用解析引擎，定出 9.297476；第二列是履約價 120"
" 的賣權，定出 18.839544；第三列是同一個賣權但改成美式行使，在本來該放價格的位置上，是一段紅色的拒絕訊息，指名 "
"instrument.option.exercise.payoff_at_expiry。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:121
#: b174957a3e52481b91b3c4e254255959
msgid ""
"Three trades, one request, one total. The third could not price — an "
"American exercise with `payoff_at_expiry` unanswered — and it says so on "
"its own row and by field path, while the other two keep their numbers and"
" the total stands for what actually priced."
msgstr ""
"三筆交易、一個請求、一個合計。第三筆定不出價——美式行使而 `payoff_at_expiry` "
"沒有回答——它就在自己那一列上、用欄位路徑說明原因，而另外兩筆保住自己的數字，合計也就是真正定出價的那些的合計。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:127
#: 88ecfc2a058f4aa2ba52aa018cbd3ff2
msgid "Compare"
msgstr "比較"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:129
#: 545254cbde684b5d9b3be7308d1bf74d
msgid ""
"The compare panel prices the same trade in a *second session on the same "
"socket*, without disturbing the one in front of you. That is the cleanest"
" way to answer \"what would this be worth with three months less time "
"value\" — the second session has its own evaluation date and its own "
"graph, and closing it leaves the first untouched."
msgstr "比較面板會在*同一條連線上的第二個工作階段*為同一筆交易計價，而不打擾你眼前的那一個。要回答「少三個月時間價值時它值多少」，這是最乾淨的方式——第二個工作階段有自己的評價日與自己的物件圖，關掉它也不會動到第一個。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:135
#: 6481a64bf73747099c593a4567efaca5
msgid ""
"The compare panel: a variant evaluation date of 2026-12-01 against a base"
" of 2026-09-01, a badge reading S-19 versus S-20, and three numbers — "
"base 9.297476, variant 7.939163, and the difference −1.358313 in red."
msgstr ""
"比較面板：變體評價日是 2026-12-01，基準是 2026-09-01；一個標籤寫著 S-19 versus S-20；三個數字分別是 "
"base 9.297476、variant 7.939163，以及紅色的差額 −1.358313。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:139
#: 7b4771b9c6964ba49fea85bfcaeb5da6
msgid ""
"Three months of time value, priced in a session of its own. The badge "
"names both sessions, which is the whole of the claim above: `S-20` was "
"opened on the same socket, priced and closed, and `S-19` — the one in "
"front of you — never moved."
msgstr ""
"三個月的時間價值，在它自己的工作階段裡定價。那個標籤把兩個工作階段都寫了出來，這正是上面那句話的全部：`S-20` 在同一條 socket "
"上開起來、定完價再關掉，而你眼前的 `S-19` 從頭到尾沒有動過。"

