#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:157
#: 997364ae55344fbc91988012cb8a8c00
msgid ""
"A cancelled sweep comes back as a *result*, not an error: \"cancelled "
"after 229 of 1500 scenario points\", with the ladder trimmed to what "
"actually priced and the quote restored. A cancelled batched Monte Carlo "
"says \"cancelled after 200000 of 20000000 paths\"."
msgstr ""
"被取消的掃描回來的是一個*結果*，不是一個錯誤：「cancelled after 229 of 1500 scenario "
"points」，階梯圖裁到實際計過價的部分，報價也已放回。被取消的分批蒙地卡羅則說「cancelled after 200000 of "
"20000000 paths」。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:162
#: 9a71d5b3170544498c36275789e1a6c0
msgid ""
"The Monte Carlo panel after a cancel: the badge reads error, the counter "
"reads 1,000,000 of 200,000,000 paths at 2296 ms round trip, a red box "
"says \"cancelled by client\", and the partial convergence trace is still "
"drawn beside it."
msgstr ""
"取消之後的蒙地卡羅面板：標籤變成 error，計數停在 1,000,000 of 200,000,000 paths、往返 2296 "
"毫秒，一個紅色方框寫著「cancelled by client」，而旁邊那條畫到一半的收斂軌跡仍然留著。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:166
#: e774d26eec3a45fdacbcca8674f12ab7
msgid ""
"The cheap kind of cancel, two seconds into a two-hundred-million-path "
"run. The batch boundary was the seam it stopped at, the trace it had "
"already drawn is kept, and the session stayed live — the next request "
"went out on the same warm graph."
msgstr "便宜的那種取消，發生在一次兩億條路徑的計算開始兩秒之後。它停在批次的邊界上，已經畫出來的軌跡被保留下來，工作階段也還活著——下一個請求就直接送到同一份熱著的物件圖上。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/studies.md:172
#: 05c2c76924f548279c2a00d0e3303c7a
msgid ""
"The last row is the one to be honest about: QuantLib cannot be "
"interrupted inside an engine call. The service gives you your session "
"back in a quarter of a second and rebuilds it, but the abandoned "
"calculation keeps running on a thread nobody is listening to until it "
"finishes on its own. Cancelling is still worth doing there — it is a "
"promise about your session, not about the CPU."
msgstr ""
"最後一列是必須誠實面對的：QuantLib "
"在引擎呼叫內部無法被中斷。服務在四分之一秒內把工作階段還給你並加以重建，但被放生的那段計算仍在一個沒有人在聽的執行緒上跑，直到它自己算完為止。在那裡取消仍然值得——它是對你的工作階段的承諾，不是對"
" CPU 的承諾。"

